# Process of S1 to Damage information

## Steps

### As part of 01_raw
1. run GEE and export tiles with S1 images
2. run GEE and export vx and vy tiles
3. run unzip_s1.py to unzip all files/folders

### As part of 02_processed
1. run NeRD (run_nerd.py) to analyse S1 tiles and obtain the following (ideally on a cluster)
    - dmg
    - crevS
    - alphaC
2. run_delta_amgle.py to calculate the difference betwen velocity angle and alphaC
    - delta-alpha
    - emax
    - emin
    - delta_theta
3. run_activeness.py
    - act

### As part of 02_cleaned
1. run merge_tiles.py to merge all tiles of one year into one
2. run resample_tiles.py to resample data to a lower resolution and clip it to green et al. (2022) coastlines. For the years 2023+ the coastline of 2022 is used.